<title>USA: Cyclone threatens S.Indian Ocean shipping - WSC.</title>
<headline>Cyclone threatens S.Indian Ocean shipping - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Melanie-Bellamine, a very powerful storm with 120 mph top winds, is threatening shipping in the southern Indian Ocean, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It is centred near 11s/82e and tracking to the west-southwest. It is expected to pick up foward speed and graudally weaken over the next 48 hours.</p>
</text>
